\DOC SHARPEN_INEQ_TAC

\TYPE {SHARPEN_INEQ_TAC : tactic}

\SYNOPSIS
Rewrites a real non-strict inequality goal {t <= u} into the strict form
{t < u + &1}.

\DESCRIBE
Takes no arguments. Applied to a goal whose conclusion is a real-valued {<=}
comparison, it adds {&1} to the right-hand side and strictens the relation,
leaving the left-hand side and the assumptions untouched:
{
       A ?- t <= u
   ========================  SHARPEN_INEQ_TAC
      A ?- t < u + &1
}

\COMMENTS
In all observed traces only this single transformation occurs, always on goals
of this {<=} shape over the reals with a large unchanged assumption list.

\ENDDOC
